{"version": 1, "slug": "tistory-12", "visibility": "public", "title": "[DreamHack] - Find the USB", "content": "<div class=\"tistory-content\">\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/a101c6dce7a8375a8a42066cc2ae71d1acaf975a9f37124b156d069ffbdc5109.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>맥 환경에서 드림핵 포렌식 문제 Find the USB 문제를 풀어볼 것이다.</p>\n<p><i>맥 환경에서 진행할 때 필요한 도구(libewf) 설치</i></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>E01 파일을 다운로드 후 직접 마운트하기 어려워 RAW 포맷으로 변환</b></h4>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>ewfexport ~/Downloads/DiskImage.E01</code></pre>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Export format : raw</li>\n<li>Target path : /Users/맥이름/Downloads~~/DIskImage</li>\n<li>Evidence segment file size : 0</li>\n<li>staff offset : 0</li>\n<li>Bytes to export :</li>\n<li>63698334208(전체 -&gt; 그냥 enter)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>결과 : DiskImage.raw 파일 생성 (약 60GB)</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>RAW 이미지 마운트</b></h4>\n<p>생산된 RAW 이미지를 macOS에 마운트</p>\n<pre class=\"bash\"><code>hdiutil attach -imagekey diskimage-class=CRawDiskImage /Users/맥이름/Downloads/DiskImage.raw</code></pre>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/145b61045cd904f80330561d31c1937416bfaadc14083ec1927cf5ac9e4de3eb.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Windows 레지스트리 파일 추출</b></h4>\n<p>USB 연결 정보는 Windows 레지스트리의 SYSTEM 하이브에 저장되어 있음</p>\n<p>SYSTEM 파일을 확인 후 Desktop으로 복사</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/6e3a8657ba38b4d047624cf2a52c7adab56913e3a4e07cb1f3c9bd94405288d2.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/5fa6add622d04167d29c1b3b8f8d4dd6acc92718d1409e076a3b74b80b29c63c.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>Python으로 레지스트리 분석</b></h4>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/ba4e7bc6c68814e0d47a72dc518b0db8f14b61ffb13a0efc426cd8594870fc58.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>python-registry 라이브러리 설치</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/c1f4b091e10d53e35bac885034e58ba3cef49e4e8eb8ed512e635344135f1771.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>첫 시도로 USBSTOR만 확인 -&gt; VID와 PID 확인 불가</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4><b>VID/PID 찾기</b></h4>\n<p>VID와 PID는 USB 레지스트리 키에 있다는 것 확인</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/5494fd5b40041a71eff22ee4c0e3eaf79503d1b67095bbbf566d59db2015cb4d.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>VID : 058F</li>\n<li>PID : 6387</li>\n<li>DeviveSerialNumber : 03A49E55</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n</div>", "assets": ["145b61045cd904f80330561d31c1937416bfaadc14083ec1927cf5ac9e4de3eb.png", "5494fd5b40041a71eff22ee4c0e3eaf79503d1b67095bbbf566d59db2015cb4d.png", "5fa6add622d04167d29c1b3b8f8d4dd6acc92718d1409e076a3b74b80b29c63c.png", "6e3a8657ba38b4d047624cf2a52c7adab56913e3a4e07cb1f3c9bd94405288d2.png", "a101c6dce7a8375a8a42066cc2ae71d1acaf975a9f37124b156d069ffbdc5109.png", "ba4e7bc6c68814e0d47a72dc518b0db8f14b61ffb13a0efc426cd8594870fc58.png", "c1f4b091e10d53e35bac885034e58ba3cef49e4e8eb8ed512e635344135f1771.png"]}